   "text": "the same views as Report, 📊 Results by the same code; live has no ⚙️ Process on a Task: red, 🚧 Next steps,\nas the Block and the Job have it, a proposal;\nevery section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\n🙋 Interaction is every view's last section and holds its own forms;\nthe right rail: Report · Work · Studio · Interactions · Delivery · Timeline · Skills · Files, as served 261108",
